le of Inab in 1149 where he led the Christian forces to a decisive victory over the Muslim armies the battle was an important turning point in the history of the Crusader states*", "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.5728942155838013}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.033646807074546814}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.0224145520478487}, {"token": "300", "logprob": -6.9141146923357155e-06}, {"token": "+", "logprob": -0.00020704510097857565}, {"token": " word", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " summary", "logprob": -3.6954811548639555e-06}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00012444675667211413}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.00030298411729745567}, {"token": " Wikipedia", "logprob": -6.794698856538162e-05}, {"token": " page", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.17083221673965454}, {"token": "https", "logprob": -0.6931717395782471}, {"token": "://", "logprob": -0.0014031813479959965}, {"token": "en", "logprob": -2.0265558760002023e-06}, {"token": ".wikipedia", "logprob": -0.000339569611242041}, {"token": ".org", "logprob": -0.001256391522474587}, {"token": "/wiki", "logprob": -2.7418097943154862e-06}, {"token": "/R", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "ay", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "mond", "logprob": -2.3841830625315197e-06}, {"token": "_", "logprob": -1.490105023549404e-05}, {"token": "III", "logprob": -5.722029527532868e-06}, {"token": ",_", "logprob": -0.034840356558561325}, {"token": "Count", "logprob": -9.846202738117427e-05}, {"token": "_of", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "_T", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "rip", "logprob": -0.0001456631434848532}, {"token": "oli", "logprob": -2.145764938177308e-06}, {"token": "\"", "logprob": -4.0531076592742465e-06}, {"token": " without", "logprob": -0.0004991239402443171}, {"token": " commas", "logprob": -1.6093124941107817e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.0001590125466464087